s obtained by multiplying the first row of the identity matrix  by $-4$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=-4{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =E\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $EA$ is equivalent to applying the row operation ${R}_{1}:=-4{R}_{1}$ to $A.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186436815 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115246 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "f0f47800-98b3-512e-af20-1899e6b0c86d" :knowledge-point/title "Finding a Row Operation That's Equivalent To Left Multiplication by an Elementary Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "46c940ea-d23e-573b-94e4-9b08dcb0d527" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+(-8){R}_{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186436767} {:answer/id #uuid "4833bf41-8721-53ee-a05b-eef1d1d7ffbe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{2}:=-8{R}_{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186436768} {:answer/id #uuid "74604d91-78d7-5d75-a2b1-c1116cb378c2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+8{R}_{1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186436777} {:answer/id #uuid "dd6ef404-d51f-5dc8-8232-ced9b78b97ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{1}:=8{R}_{1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186436794} {:answer/id #uuid "eb024a6c-2255-51f9-a1ab-f1df1f59e9cb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-8){R}_{1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186436797}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "eb024a6c-2255-51f9-a1ab-f1df1f59e9cb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-8){R}_{1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186436797} :answer-field/id #uuid "a02475ca-ca51-5bbb-9fb2-8ed70c95ef71" :answer-fi